{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Distant World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the distant world of Ondarea, war machines walk the planet long after the collapse. Discover decaying cities, snow-choked military outposts, and industrial relics of a lost age\u2014each mission peeling back the truth behind the cause of the drone lands, and questioning the purpose of a connection that never truly existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.poster.avif?t=1772118832\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.webm?t=1772118832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/e77d5f2f30b44ac006908d661ad69552.mp4?t=1772118832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stylish Acrobatic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, boost, and strike with precision. Chain mobility and attacks to dismantle enemies in fast-paced encounters that reward timing, spacing, and control. Use everything you've got to complete your missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.poster.avif?t=1772118832\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.webm?t=1772118832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/1d0114f415f14c8d389108f893066b9f.mp4?t=1772118832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Build Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Knight\u2014body, weapons, and tuning. Each part affects how you fight and what you're capable of. Adapt your loadout, craft machines tailored to your playstyle and mission demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.poster.avif?t=1772118832\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.webm?t=1772118832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/extras/926f924fa1feaf5c42cf6103c2c030ca.mp4?t=1772118832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499590?t=1772118832","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/b19b5b49efb6f0fde809c63daea6f1cf08a61153/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772118832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/c86b6fea9c4675deae6b77daac50a8375ca56018/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772118832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499590/c86b6fea9c4675deae6b77daac50a8375ca56018/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772118832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Distant World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On th